abstract: "Seeded CPU-only simulation study of the confidence-scheduled verification allocator shipped by DeepSeek's DeepInfer, replaying the deployment Q&A's fixed-versus-dynamic serving table and bounding the ranking quality its gains require. Every number quoted in the repository's prose is captured from a committed artifact by a regex locator and census-tested in CI."
